---
title: "is_obligation_safe (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_calc_debts: debts_value_usd_for_borrow(obligation)
    q_calc_debts --> q_iter_debts: for each debt_type in obligation.debts
    q_iter_debts --> q_get_debt_price: get_price_with_check(x_oracle, debt_type, ema, spot, tolerance)
    q_get_debt_price --> q_calc_debt_val: debt_value = debt_amount * borrow_index * price / decimals
    q_calc_debt_val --> q_weight_debt: weighted_debt = debt_value * borrow_weight
    q_weight_debt --> q_sum_debts: total_weighted_debt += weighted_debt
    q_sum_debts --> q_iter_debts: next debt
    q_sum_debts --> q_calc_collaterals: all debts processed
    q_calc_collaterals --> q_iter_cols: for each deposit_type in obligation.ctokens
    q_iter_cols --> q_check_is_col: collateral_factor > 0?
    q_check_is_col --> q_skip_col: not collateral (factor == 0)
    q_check_is_col --> q_get_col_price: is collateral
    q_skip_col --> q_iter_cols: next deposit
    q_get_col_price --> q_calc_col_val: col_value = ctoken_amount * exchange_rate * price / decimals
    q_calc_col_val --> q_weight_col: weighted_col = col_value * collateral_factor
    q_weight_col --> q_sum_cols: total_weighted_col += weighted_col
    q_sum_cols --> q_iter_cols: next deposit
    q_sum_cols --> q_compare: all deposits processed
    q_compare --> q_safe: total_weighted_debt <= total_weighted_col
    q_compare --> q_unsafe: total_weighted_debt > total_weighted_col
    q_safe --> [*]: return true (safe)
    q_unsafe --> [*]: return false (unsafe)

    note right of q_compare
        INV-001: EMA/spot price difference check enforced per asset (tolerance_bps)
        INV-002: borrow_weight >= 1.0 inflates debt value for risk
        INV-003: collateral_factor < 1.0 deflates collateral value for risk
        INV-004: exchange_rate converts ctoken to underlying value
        INV-005: uses borrow_index to compute current debt (with accrued interest)
    end note
